<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA V WEST INDIES SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA V WEST INDIES SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the second day of</p>
<p>the third test between Australia and West Indies at the</p>
<p>Melbourne Cricket Ground on Friday.</p>
<p>Australia first innings 219 (Greg Blewett 62, Curtly Ambrose</p>
<p>five for 55)</p>
<p>West Indies first innings (overnight 29 for one)</p>
<p> S.Campbell lbw b McGrath		    7</p>
<p> R.Samuels c Taylor b Warne		 17</p>
<p> S.Chanderpaul c and b McGrath	    58</p>
<p> B.Lara c Warne b McGrath		    2</p>
<p> C.Hooper run out				7</p>
<p> J.Adams not out				54</p>
<p> J.Murray c Reiffel b McGrath	     53</p>
<p> I.Bishop lbw b McGrath			0</p>
<p> C.Ambrose b Warne			     8</p>
<p> K.Benjamin b Reiffel			 11</p>
<p> C.Walsh not out				 2</p>
<p> Extras (lb-7 b-4 nb-3)		     14</p>
<p> Total (for nine wickets, 103 overs)   233</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-12, 2-62, 3-71, 4-86, 5-107, 6-197,</p>
<p>7-197, 8-215, 9-230.</p>
<p>Bowling: McGrath 27-10-40-5, Reiffel 29-8-76-1 (nb-3), Warne</p>
<p>25-3-60-2, Gillespie 3-2-5-0, Blewett 9-3-19-0, S.Waugh</p>
<p>10-5-22-0.</p>
